// B10 row 31 and its twin: a Stopwatch first, so Kimi.Time's static slot is Initialized before any handler reads the clock
// (handler rule 2); then the ticks, and "Hello" through WaitingBoard. The TimerTick file the row lists decides the end.
var warm = Time.Stopwatch.init()
warm.start()
warm.stop()
Interrupts.install()
X86.enableInterrupts()
Console.writeLine("Hello")
